    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not really about what we do directly, it's about the costs. the people i talk to in the industry are saying our energy bills and compliance paperwork are going to skyrocket because of these changes. it feels like these rules are being made without any regard for how much they'll hurt small businesses. do you think these mandates are actually justified given the economic strain they put on us?",
